  "sections": {
    "overview": "<div style=\"max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 3rem;text-align:center;\"><h2 class=\"text-on-surface\" style=\"font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:1rem;\">Building a Private Knowledge Base Chatbot</h2><p class=\"text-on-surface-variant\" style=\"font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.7;\">This section explains the core architecture behind applications like NotebookLM. To build a chatbot restricted entirely to your own documents, we use a technique called <strong>RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)</strong>. Interact with the diagram below to understand the workflow.</p></div><div class=\"interactive-box\" style=\"padding:2rem 2.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem;\"><h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1.5rem;text-align:center;\">The RAG Workflow</h3><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.75rem;\"><div class=\"rag-flow-row\"><button data-rag-step=\"1\" style=\"width:100%;background:var(--surface-container);border:2px solid var(--outline);border-radius:12px;padding:1rem 0.5rem;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;\"><div style=\"font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">&#128100;</div><strong style=\"font-size:0.8rem;\">1. User Query</strong></button><div class=\"rag-flow-arrow\">&#10142;</div><button data-rag-step=\"2\" style=\"width:100%;background:var(--surface-container);border:2px solid var(--outline);border-radius:12px;padding:1rem 0.5rem;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;\"><div style=\"font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">&#128451;</div><strong style=\"font-size:0.8rem;\">2. Vector Search</strong></button><div class=\"rag-flow-arrow\">&#10142;</div><button data-rag-step=\"3\" style=\"width:100%;background:var(--surface-container);border:2px solid var(--outline);border-radius:12px;padding:1rem 0.5rem;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;\"><div style=\"font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">&#128196;</div><strong style=\"font-size:0.8rem;\">3. Retrieve Context</strong></button><div class=\"rag-flow-arrow\">&#10142;</div><button data-rag-step=\"4\" style=\"width:100%;background:rgba(5,150,105,0.12);border:2px solid #059669;border-radius:12px;padding:1rem 0.5rem;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;\"><div style=\"font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">&#129302;</div><strong style=\"font-size:0.8rem;\">4. LLM Inference</strong></button><div class=\"rag-flow-arrow\">&#10142;</div><button data-rag-step=\"5\" style=\"width:100%;background:var(--surface-container);border:2px solid var(--outline);border-radius:12px;padding:1rem 0.5rem;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;\"><div style=\"font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">&#128172;</div><strong style=\"font-size:0.8rem;\">5. Final Answer</strong></button></div></div><div id=\"rag-step-panel\" style=\"margin-top:1.5rem;padding:1.5rem 2rem;background:var(--surface-container-low);border:1px solid var(--outline);border-radius:12px;min-height:90px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><p class=\"text-on-surface-variant\" style=\"text-align:center;font-style:italic;\">Click on any step above to see how the system ensures the chatbot only answers using your data.</p></div></div>",

    "tech": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:2rem;\"><h2 class=\"text-on-surface\" style=\"font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">Architectural Components</h2><p class=\"text-on-surface-variant\">To implement a RAG system, you need two distinct technologies working together: a storage system for your knowledge, and an inference engine (the \"brain\"). Explore the options below.</p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem;\" class=\"arch-grid\"><div style=\"background:var(--surface-container-low);border:1px solid var(--outline);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"background:var(--surface-container);padding:1rem 1.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--outline);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><h3 class=\"text-on-surface\" style=\"font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;\">1. Vector Database (Storage)</h3><span style=\"font-size:1.5rem;\">&#128452;</span></div><div style=\"padding:1.5rem;\"><p class=\"text-on-surface-variant\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;\">Converts your documents (PDFs, Word, TXT) into mathematical vectors so the system can perform \"semantic searches\" (finding meaning, not just keywords).</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;\"><div style=\"padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--outline);border-radius:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\"><h4 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#059669;\">Local / Open Source</h4><span style=\"background:rgba(5,150,105,0.15);color:#059669;font-size:0.7rem;padding:0.25rem 0.75rem;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;\">100% Private</span></div><p style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--on-surface-variant);margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">Runs on your own hardware. No subscription fees.</p><ul style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--on-surface);list-style:disc;padding-left:1.25rem;\"><li><strong>ChromaDB:</strong> Excellent for starting, very easy to integrate with Python.</li><li><strong>Qdrant:</strong> Highly performant, great for scaling locally.</li></ul></div><div style=\"padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--outline);border-radius:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\"><h4 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#d97706;\">Cloud Managed</h4><span style=\"background:var(--surface-container-high);color:var(--on-surface-variant);font-size:0.7rem;padding:0.25rem 0.75rem;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;\">Easy Setup</span></div><p style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--on-surface-variant);margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">Hosted externally. Requires internet, potential data compliance checks.</p><ul style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--on-surface);list-style:disc;padding-left:1.25rem;\"><li><strong>Pinecone:</strong> Industry standard, very fast, but can get expensive.</li><li><strong>Weaviate Cloud:</strong> Robust enterprise features.</li></ul></div></div></div></div><div style=\"background:var(--surface-container-low);border:1px solid var(--outline);border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;right:0;background:#059669;color:white;font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:700;padding:0.3rem 0.75rem;border-bottom-left-radius:8px;\">Critical Decision</div><div style=\"background:var(--surface-container);padding:1rem 1.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--outline);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><h3 class=\"text-on-surface\" style=\"font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;\">2. LLM Engine (Inference)</h3><span style=\"font-size:1.5rem;\">&#129416;</span></div><div style=\"padding:1.5rem;\"><p class=\"text-on-surface-variant\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;\">The model that reads the retrieved context and formulates the final human-like response based <em>only</em> on that context.</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;\"><div style=\"padding:1rem;border:2px solid #059669;background:rgba(5,150,105,0.08);border-radius:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\"><h4 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#059669;font-size:1rem;\">Local Execution (RECOMMENDED)</h4><span style=\"background:#059669;color:white;font-size:0.7rem;padding:0.25rem 0.75rem;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;\">Best Value &amp; Privacy</span></div><p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--on-surface);margin-bottom:0.5rem;\"><strong>Recommended setup:</strong> Run <strong>Phi-4 (14B)</strong> or Llama 3 (8B) locally using Ollama or LM Studio.</p><ul style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--on-surface);list-style:none;\"><li>&#10003; <strong>Cost:</strong> Free (after hardware purchase).</li><li>&#10003; <strong>Privacy:</strong> Data never leaves your building.</li><li>&#10003; <strong>Performance:</strong> Phi-4 is exceptional for RAG and reading comprehension without requiring massive enterprise GPUs.</li></ul></div><div style=\"padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--outline);border-radius:8px;\"><h4 style=\"font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">External API (Cloud)</h4><p style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--on-surface-variant);margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">Call external models. Good for non-sensitive data.</p><ul style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--on-surface);list-style:disc;padding-left:1.25rem;\"><li><strong>GPT-4o-mini / Claude Haiku:</strong> Cheap, fast, good for basic document Q&amp;A.</li><li><strong>GPT-5.5 (via API):</strong> Use <em>only</em> for highly complex, multi-step analytical reasoning where local models fail. Expensive.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div>",

    "platforms": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:2rem;\"><h2 class=\"text-on-surface\" style=\"font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">Ready-to-Use Platforms</h2><p class=\"text-on-surface-variant\">If you don't want to code the connection between the Vector DB and the LLM from scratch, several platforms provide this out-of-the-box with a user interface similar to NotebookLM.</p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:1.5rem;\"><div style=\"background:var(--surface-container-low);border:1px solid var(--outline);border-radius:12px;padding:1.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:box-shadow 0.2s;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:1rem;\"><div style=\"width:2.5rem;height:2.5rem;border-radius:8px;background:#292524;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;\">A</div><h3 style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;\">AnythingLLM</h3></div><p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--on-surface-variant);flex-grow:1;margin-bottom:1rem;\">An excellent desktop or server application built exactly for this. It allows you to select your LLM (local or cloud) and Vector DB seamlessly.</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:0.85rem;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;margin-right:0.5rem;\">&#10003;</span>Super easy setup</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:0.85rem;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;margin-right:0.5rem;\">&#10003;</span>Natively supports local Phi-4</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:0.85rem;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;margin-right:0.5rem;\">&#10003;</span>Built-in UI similar to ChatGPT</div></div></div><div style=\"background:var(--surface-container-low);border:1px solid var(--outline);border-radius:12px;padding:1.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:box-shadow 0.2s;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:1rem;\"><div style=\"width:2.5rem;height:2.5rem;border-radius:8px;background:#2563eb;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;\">D</div><h3 style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;\">Dify.ai</h3></div><p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--on-surface-variant);flex-grow:1;margin-bottom:1rem;\">More advanced. An open-source LLM app development platform. Allows you to build visual workflows for complex routing.</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:0.85rem;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;margin-right:0.5rem;\">&#10003;</span>Visual workflow builder</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:0.85rem;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;margin-right:0.5rem;\">&#10003;</span>Highly customizable guardrails</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:0.85rem;\"><span style=\"color:#d97706;margin-right:0.5rem;\">&#9888;</span>Steeper learning curve</div></div></div><div style=\"background:var(--surface-container-low);border:1px solid var(--outline);border-radius:12px;padding:1.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:box-shadow 0.2s;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:1rem;\"><div style=\"width:2.5rem;height:2.5rem;border-radius:8px;background:#7c3aed;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;\">Q</div><h3 style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;\">Quivr</h3></div><p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--on-surface-variant);flex-grow:1;margin-bottom:1rem;\">Marketed as your \"second brain\". Open source and focuses heavily on document ingestion and user-friendly interaction.</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:0.85rem;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;margin-right:0.5rem;\">&#10003;</span>Great for massive document bases</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:0.85rem;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;margin-right:0.5rem;\">&#10003;</span>Cloud or Self-hosted</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:0.85rem;\"><span style=\"color:#d97706;margin-right:0.5rem;\">&#9888;</span>Resource heavy to host locally</div></div></div></div>",

    "costs": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:2rem;\"><h2 class=\"text-on-surface\" style=\"font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">Cost Analysis &amp; Recommendations</h2><p class=\"text-on-surface-variant\">Estimate your 1-Year Total Cost of Ownership (TCO) based on usage. The chart dynamically updates based on your query volume.</p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem;\" class=\"costs-grid\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5rem;\"><div style=\"background:var(--surface-container-low);border:1px solid var(--outline);border-radius:12px;padding:1.5rem;\"><label style=\"display:block;font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">Expected Monthly Queries:</label><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--on-surface-variant);margin-bottom:0.25rem;\"><span>Low (500)</span><span>High (50k+)</span></div><input type=\"range\" id=\"ragUsageSlider\" min=\"1\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\" style=\"width:100%;height:0.5rem;border-radius:999px;appearance:none;cursor:pointer;accent-color:#059669;\"><div style=\"margin-top:1rem;text-align:center;\"><span id=\"ragQueryDisplay\" style=\"font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;color:#059669;\">10,000</span><span style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--on-surface-variant);display:block;\">queries / month</span></div></div><div style=\"background:#1c1917;border:1px solid #44403c;border-radius:12px;padding:1.5rem;color:white;\"><h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;\"><span style=\"color:#34d399;\">&#10025;</span>The Architect's Verdict</h3><p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:#a8a29e;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid #44403c;\">Based on cost efficiency and absolute data privacy (guardrails), the optimal solution is:</p><ul style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.75rem;font-size:0.875rem;\"><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;\"><span style=\"color:#34d399;flex-shrink:0;\">&#10140;</span><span><strong>Platform:</strong> AnythingLLM (Installed locally)</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;\"><span style=\"color:#34d399;flex-shrink:0;\">&#10140;</span><span><strong>Database:</strong> Built-in local Vector DB</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;\"><span style=\"color:#34d399;flex-shrink:0;\">&#10140;</span><span style=\"color:#6ee7b7;font-weight:700;\">Inference: Run Phi-4 (14B) locally via Ollama.</span></li></ul><p style=\"font-size:0.75rem;color:#57534e;margin-top:1rem;font-style:italic;\">* Only utilize GPT-5.5 via API if the local Phi-4 fails to handle extremely complex multi-document synthesis, and ensure no confidential PII is transmitted.</p></div></div><div style=\"background:var(--surface-container-low);border:1px solid var(--outline);border-radius:12px;padding:1.5rem 2rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;\"><h3 class=\"text-on-surface\" style=\"font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1rem;\">1-Year Cumulative Cost Projection</h3><div class=\"chart-container\" style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:50vh;max-height:500px;min-height:300px;\"><canvas id=\"ragCostChart\"></canvas></div></div></div>"
  },
  "chartData": { "ragCost": true }
